{
  "_comment": "Room settings template. bin/lead-start fills env and drops _comment; it adds the protected branches' push denies (office.json noPush) and room.env, room.deny and room.prodRead; rules syntax: code.claude.com/docs/en/permissions (Bash(prefix *) globs; mcp__server__* tool-name globs, no parentheses). Draft PRs are allowed (docs/room-lifecycle.md). Limit: globs cannot express \"gh pr create without --draft\", and deny beats allow, so a ready PR is not blocked by settings; the dev-team skill forbids it and the owner promotes drafts. gh pr ready is denied, so only the owner promotes a draft. bin/land is allowed as bin/land or <path>/bin/land, but bin/land --no-checks is denied (deny beats allow). Rooms never open rooms: claude --bg (in any argument position), bin/team start, bin/lead-start and bin/role run are denied, and so are end-session and team resolve (only the control room resolves and ends sessions). bin/lead-start drops the draft-PR allow and the bin/land allows that its recipe (--team) does not grant.",
  "env": {
    "CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_SUBAGENT_SPAWN_DEPTH": "1",
    "COMPOSE_PROJECT_NAME": "{{COMPOSE_PROJECT_NAME}}",
    "ROOM_PORT_BASE": "{{PORT_BASE}}"
  },
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(gh pr create --draft*)",
      "Bash(bin/land *)",
      "Bash(*/bin/land *)"
    ],
    "deny": [
      "Bash(claude --bg*)",
      "Bash(claude *--bg*)",
      "Bash(*bin/land*--no-checks*)",
      "Bash(gh pr ready*)",
      "Bash(*bin/lead-start*)",
      "Bash(*bin/role run*)",
      "Bash(*bin/team start*)",
      "Bash(*busybody lead-start*)",
      "Bash(*busybody role run*)",
      "Bash(*busybody team start*)",
      "Bash(*busybody land*--no-checks*)",
      "Bash(*end-session*)",
      "Bash(*team resolve*)",
      "Bash(git push * main)",
      "Bash(git push * main *)",
      "Bash(git push *:main)",
      "Bash(git push *:main *)",
      "Bash(git push *refs/heads/main*)",
      "Bash(git push --all*)",
      "Bash(git push --mirror*)",
      "Bash(git push * --all*)",
      "Bash(git push * --mirror*)",
      "Bash(git push *--force*)",
      "Bash(git push * -f)",
      "Bash(git push * -f *)",
      "Bash(git push *+*)",
      "Bash(git -C * push *)",
      "Bash(git -c * push *)",
      "Bash(git --git-dir=* push *)",
      "Bash(git *--no-verify*)",
      "Bash(git *core.hooksPath*)",
      "Bash(git config *hooksPath*)",
      "Bash(gh pr merge*)",
      "Bash(gh pr * --admin*)",
      "Bash(gh api *-X POST*)",
      "Bash(gh api *-XPOST*)",
      "Bash(gh api *--method POST*)",
      "Bash(gh api *--method=POST*)",
      "Bash(gh api *-X PUT*)",
      "Bash(gh api *-XPUT*)",
      "Bash(gh api *--method PUT*)",
      "Bash(gh api *--method=PUT*)",
      "Bash(gh api *-X PATCH*)",
      "Bash(gh api *-XPATCH*)",
      "Bash(gh api *--method PATCH*)",
      "Bash(gh api *--method=PATCH*)",
      "Bash(gh api *-X DELETE*)",
      "Bash(gh api *-XDELETE*)",
